## 5. Duplicate telephone detection — exact location

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/EnsureUniqueTelephone.java`:

```java
public class EnsureUniqueTelephone {
    public void service(@Val OwnerFieldsDto request, OwnerRepository ownerRepository)
            throws DuplicateTelephoneException {
        String telephone = request.getTelephone();          // already normalized to 10 digits
        for (Owner existing : ownerRepository.findAll()) {
            if (telephone.equals(TelephoneNormalizer.digits(existing.getTelephone()))) {
                throw new DuplicateTelephoneException(telephone);
            }
        }
    }
}
```

Runs after `NormalizeOwnerTelephone`. Compares normalized-vs-normalized (formatting differences don't hide a collision). `DuplicateTelephoneException` (checked) → `DuplicateTelephoneExceptionHandler` responds **409** with `ProblemDetail` property `telephone`.

